---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AppHeader from '@/components/AppHeader.astro';
import AppFooter from '@/components/AppFooter.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 12, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Awesome Directories"
  description="Terms of Service for Awesome Directories - Understand your rights and responsibilities when using our service."
>
  <AppHeader />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Welcome to Awesome Directories! By accessing or using our service,
            you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree
            with any part of these terms, please do not use our service.
          </p>
          <p>
            Awesome Directories is an open-source project licensed under the
            Apache 2.0 License. The source code is publicly available and
            contributions are welcome.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            2. Service Description
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Awesome Directories provides a curated database of launch
            directories for SaaS products and startups. Our service includes:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>Searchable directory of 388+ launch platforms</li>
            <li>Quality metrics including Domain Ratings and SEO data</li>
            <li>User authentication via Google and GitHub OAuth</li>
            <li>Community features (submissions, favorites, voting, reviews)</li>
            <li>Export functionality (PDF/CSV)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            3. Open Source "As-Is" Disclaimer
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 font-semibold text-lg">
            THIS SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT
            WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-3">
            As an open-source project, Awesome Directories is provided without
            warranty of any kind, including but not limited to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>Accuracy or completeness of directory information</li>
            <li>Availability or uptime of the service</li>
            <li>Fitness for a particular purpose</li>
            <li>Non-infringement of third-party rights</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            4. User Accounts & Authentication
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            To access certain features, you must create an account using OAuth
            authentication via Google or GitHub.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-3">You are responsible for:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>Maintaining the security of your OAuth provider account</li>
            <li>All activities that occur under your account</li>
            <li>Notifying us of any unauthorized use</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            5. User Conduct & Community Guidelines
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When using Awesome Directories, you agree NOT to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li>Submit false, misleading, or spam directory submissions</li>
            <li>Manipulate voting systems or artificially inflate ratings</li>
            <li>Post abusive, harassing, or inappropriate content</li>
            <li>Scrape or harvest user data without permission</li>
            <li>Use automated tools (bots) without authorization</li>
            <li>Impersonate others or misrepresent your affiliation</li>
            <li>Upload viruses, malware, or malicious code</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Violations may result in content removal, account suspension, or permanent ban.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            6. Directory Submissions & User Content
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When you submit directories or content:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li>You grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license</li>
            <li>You confirm you have the right to submit the content</li>
            <li>You agree your submission doesn't infringe third-party rights</li>
            <li>Approved submissions become part of the public open-source dataset</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            7. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            The Awesome Directories source code is licensed under the Apache
            2.0 License. However:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>The "Awesome Directories" name and branding remain our property</li>
            <li>Directory data is collected from public sources</li>
            <li>User-generated content is publicly accessible</li>
            <li>Third-party trademarks belong to their respective owners</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-red-50 border-red-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            8. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 font-semibold">
            TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, AWESOME DIRECTORIES SHALL
            NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE SERVICE.
          </p>
          <p>
            As a free, community-driven open-source project, we provide this
            service without charge and cannot be held liable for its use or
            results.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            9. Changes to Service & Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">We reserve the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>Modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the service</li>
            <li>Update these Terms of Service with or without notice</li>
            <li>Change our data sources, features, or service providers</li>
            <li>Implement rate limits or usage restrictions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            10. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">For questions about these Terms of Service:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@awesome-directories.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@awesome-directories.com</a></li>
            <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/awesome-directories/awesome-directories" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline">awesome-directories/awesome-directories</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200">
          <p class="font-semibold">
            By using Awesome Directories, you acknowledge that you have read,
            understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Thank
            you for being part of our open-source community!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <AppFooter />
</BaseLayout>
